# Implementation Plan - Phase 63: The Sovereign Cloud (Deployment Finalization)

## Goal

Deploy the **Nucleus Sovereign Container** (with 20 Agents) to Google Cloud Run and verify its operational state.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This will deploy the `nucleus-sovereign` service to GCP Cloud Run.
> **Costs:** Cloud Run pricing applies (Scale-to-zero minimizes idle cost).
> **Secrets:** `GEMINI_API_KEY` will be set as an environment variable in Cloud Run.

---

## Proposed Changes

### [VERIFY] Local Docker Build

Ensure the container builds correctly after Phase 57 agent additions.

**Command:**
```bash
docker build -t nucleus-local-test -f deploy/Dockerfile.unified .
```

### [EXECUTE] Cloud Run Deployment

Trigger the Cloud Build pipeline to deploy to GCP.

#### 1. Set GCP Project

```bash
gcloud config set project gen-lang-client-0894185576
```

#### 2. Run Cloud Build

```bash
gcloud builds submit --config deploy/cloudbuild.yaml .
```

### [NEW] Post-Deployment Verification Script

Create a script to verify the live service.

#### [NEW] `scripts/verify_cloud_run.sh`

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# scripts/verify_cloud_run.sh
SERVICE_URL=$(gcloud run services describe nucleus-sovereign --region=us-central1 --format='value(status.url)')

echo "🔍 Verifying Nucleus on Cloud Run: $SERVICE_URL"

# 1. Health Check
echo "--- Health Check ---"
curl -s "$SERVICE_URL/api/health" | jq .

# 2. Agent Liveness (Check if agents are loadable via HUD status)
echo "--- Agent Status (via HUD) ---"
curl -s "$SERVICE_URL/api/status" | jq .

echo "✅ Verification Complete."
```

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests

| Test | Command | Expected Outcome |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Local Docker Build** | `docker build -t nucleus-local-test -f deploy/Dockerfile.unified .` | Exit code 0, `COPY .brain` succeeds. |
| **Local Container Run** | `docker run -p 3000:3000 -e PORT=3000 nucleus-local-test` | HUD accessible at http://localhost:3000. |
| **Verify Agents in Container** | `docker run nucleus-local-test /bin/bash -c "ls /app/.brain_seed/tools/"` | Lists 20 agent [.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/.brain/tools/sre.py) files. |

### Manual Verification (Post-Deployment)

1.  **Navigate to Cloud Run Console:** https://console.cloud.google.com/run?project=gen-lang-client-0894185576
2.  **Confirm `nucleus-sovereign` is `SERVING`.**
3.  **Open Service URL:** Click the URL provided by Cloud Run.
4.  **Observe HUD:** The Nucleus HUD (Next.js) should load, showing system status.
5.  **Run `verify_cloud_run.sh`:** Execute the verification script locally to confirm API health.

---

